!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = rip antibody: anti-m6A antibody (Sigma-Aldrich,  Cat#ABE572)
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = total RNA in PLC-8024 cells was extracted by using TRIzol™ Reagent (Invitrogen™, Cat# 15596018) and detected by Bioptic Qseq100 Bio-Fragment Analyzer (Bioptic lnc.).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Fragmented total RNA (Input) and immunoprecipitated RNA (IP) were subjected to library construction by using EpiTM mini longRNA-seq kit (Epibiotek, Cat# E1802) according to the manufacturer’s protocols.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequence reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence/low-quality sequence using CLC genomic benchwork (parameter- Quality limit: 0.05)
!Sample_data_processing = Trimmed sequence reads were mapped to GrCM38/mm10 using CLC genomic benchwork (parameters- mismath cost: 2 insertion cost: 3 deletion cost: 3 length fraction: 0.8 similarity fraction: 0.8)
!Sample_data_processing = Read count extraction and normalization were performed using CLC genomic benchwork
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: 8024-M6a1_peak_ann_SingleSite.txt.gz
